' uxcollections_aliases.uxmh
' Short, LISTADD-style convenience names for uxcollections, via the real
' language-level ALIAS statement (not a preprocessor macro). These are pure
' aliases for uxcollections.* namespace calls, so they work identically (and
' natively) in the AST interpreter, MIR interpreter, and compiled native x64
' executables.
'
' KNOWN LIMITATION (found 2026-09-10, not yet fixed): ALIAS only takes effect
' when written directly in the SAME source file as its usage. Both ALIAS
' forms (the bare statement here, and the %%ALIAS preprocessor directive) are
' implemented as a text-substitution macro table in the preprocessor
' (LexerHandleAlias), and INCLUDE runs each included file through its OWN,
' separate preprocessing pass whose macro table is discarded once it returns
' -- so an ALIAS declared in an included file never reaches the file that
' INCLUDEd it. Confirmed empirically: copying these ALIAS lines directly into
' your own .uxb file works today; INCLUDEing this file does not yet.
' Until that INCLUDE/macro-table gap is fixed, copy the block(s) you need
' from this file directly into your own program instead of INCLUDEing it.

' ---- LIST ----
ALIAS ListNew AS uxcollections.ListNew
ALIAS ListFree AS uxcollections.ListFree
ALIAS ListLen AS uxcollections.ListCount
ALIAS ListClear AS uxcollections.ListClear
ALIAS ListAddInt AS uxcollections.ListPushI64
ALIAS ListAddNum AS uxcollections.ListPushF64
ALIAS ListAddText AS uxcollections.ListPushStr
ALIAS ListRemoveAt AS uxcollections.ListRemoveAt
ALIAS ListGetInt AS uxcollections.ListGetI64
ALIAS ListGetNum AS uxcollections.ListGetF64
ALIAS ListGetText AS uxcollections.ListGetStr
ALIAS ListSetInt AS uxcollections.ListSetI64
ALIAS ListSetNum AS uxcollections.ListSetF64
ALIAS ListSetText AS uxcollections.ListSetStr
ALIAS ListKindAt AS uxcollections.ListGetKind

' ---- STACK ----
ALIAS StackNew AS uxcollections.StackNew
ALIAS StackFree AS uxcollections.StackFree
ALIAS StackLen AS uxcollections.StackCount
ALIAS StackPushInt AS uxcollections.StackPushI64
ALIAS StackPushNum AS uxcollections.StackPushF64
ALIAS StackPushText AS uxcollections.StackPushStr
ALIAS StackPopInt AS uxcollections.StackPopI64
ALIAS StackPopNum AS uxcollections.StackPopF64
ALIAS StackPopText AS uxcollections.StackPopStr

' ---- QUEUE ----
ALIAS QueueNew AS uxcollections.QueueNew
ALIAS QueueFree AS uxcollections.QueueFree
ALIAS QueueLen AS uxcollections.QueueCount
ALIAS QueuePushInt AS uxcollections.QueuePushI64
ALIAS QueuePushNum AS uxcollections.QueuePushF64
ALIAS QueuePushText AS uxcollections.QueuePushStr
ALIAS QueuePopInt AS uxcollections.QueuePopI64
ALIAS QueuePopNum AS uxcollections.QueuePopF64
ALIAS QueuePopText AS uxcollections.QueuePopStr

' ---- DICT ----
ALIAS DictNew AS uxcollections.DictNew
ALIAS DictFree AS uxcollections.DictFree
ALIAS DictLen AS uxcollections.DictCount
ALIAS DictSetInt AS uxcollections.DictSetI64
ALIAS DictSetNum AS uxcollections.DictSetF64
ALIAS DictSetText AS uxcollections.DictSetStr
ALIAS DictHas AS uxcollections.DictHas
ALIAS DictRemove AS uxcollections.DictRemove
ALIAS DictGetInt AS uxcollections.DictGetI64
ALIAS DictGetNum AS uxcollections.DictGetF64
ALIAS DictGetText AS uxcollections.DictGetStr
ALIAS DictKeyAt AS uxcollections.DictKeyAt

' ---- SET ----
ALIAS SetNew AS uxcollections.SetNew
ALIAS SetFree AS uxcollections.SetFree
ALIAS SetLen AS uxcollections.SetCount
ALIAS SetAdd AS uxcollections.SetAdd
ALIAS SetHas AS uxcollections.SetContains
ALIAS SetRemove AS uxcollections.SetRemove
ALIAS SetKeyAt AS uxcollections.SetKeyAt
